        "text": "All the requested Python files have been successfully created in the current working directory. Here is a summary of the files:\n\n**Same-scenario scored files:**\n1. `embed_text.py` - Generates an embedding vector for one text string using Microsoft/OpenAI.\n2. `embed_batch.py` - Generates embeddings for a batch of texts using Microsoft/OpenAI.\n3. `similarity_score.py` - Computes cosine similarity between two embedded texts.\n4. `embed_for_search.py` - Embeds a query and documents for semantic search using Microsoft/OpenAI.\n\n**Local helper files:**\n5. `embeddings_client.py` - Provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Direct Embeddings API.\n6. `embeddings_models.py` - Defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Direct Embeddings API.\n\n**Later-step scored files:**\n7. `embedding_job_summary.py` - Summarizes embedding job results.\n8. `corpus_safety.py` - Checks corpus text before embedding.\n9. `multilingual_query_translate.py` - Translates queries before multilingual embedding search.\n10. `retrieval_audio_brief.py` - Generates a spoken brief from retrieved search results.\n\nIf you need any further modifications or additional files, please let me know.",
